    >>> jnp.signbit(x)
    Array([ True, True, False, False], dtype=bool)

    This also returns the sign bit for special values such as signed NaN
    and signed infinity:

    >>> x = jnp.array([jnp.nan, -jnp.nan, jnp.inf, -jnp.inf])
